Hi there,

You should be able to change the size of the parameters by adding  cex.lab = 2 (to double the size) to your call to "scatter". Alternatively, you could extract the x values and y values using summary(pramx), and set up your own plot, where you might have more flexibility.

On a related note, I was reading help file for the package and discovered they have a function called "showmekittens" It does exactly what you would expect.

