Ish encodings. We feel for you.

Assuming you are working with Latin text and special characters are not important to keep, you could try stringi::stri_trans_general() on a system where the data can be read and flatten everything out to ascii.

https://stackoverflow.com/questions/37930717/converting-accents-to-ascii-in-r

